{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pumpkin Woods is a  single player\u00a0witch-themed open world survival craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/description4.png?t=1744555746\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect magical ingredients and build your cozy witch home while exploring the wonderful sights and secrets of these mysterious lands. Beware though, danger might be lurking deep in these woods...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/dresser.gif?t=1744555746\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom outfits for your witch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft tools to gather magical resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Manage your health, happiness, hunger and thirst</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adopt a companion cat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Furnish your secluded witch cabin</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/description3.png?t=1744555746\" /> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roam around on your fancy traveller wagon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brew potions and trade with merchants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the beautiful locations on an enchanted broom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intriguing wildlife encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Procedural generation for a unique experience  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/description1.png?t=1744555746\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2729830?t=1744555746"